@aaronber0614 Reviewed commit `a231465581cb3015feaf069199b84cda432ce6cc`; no blocking findings.

The per-family `.dep` files preserve the common/base cache inputs and the existing include chain. XGS and DNX now track their own build definitions and artifact fingerprints, correcting the previous DNX dependency on the XGS fingerprint. This is cache metadata only; package contents are unchanged. Expect an initial cache miss for the affected SAI packages and dependent targets after merge.

The Broadcom build and cache-completeness gate are passing. The remaining KVM checks are still running and the overall pipeline is pending, so please wait for the remaining required CI before merging. Code review recommendation: approve.

